Subject: [PATCH 1/3] J714s developer image (upstream, experimental):
 aurora-silicon kernel and Aura

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.up273-4 (aurora-silicon/linux integration/aurora f1b79c4b
plus betizzel/omarchy-m5 patches/upstream-27.3/0001, 0004 and 0005: the 27.3 GPU and DCP,
the 27.3 ANE and AVE, the front camera) and m1n1-aurora 1.6.1.aurora24.up273-2 (Aura
1.0.0b11 plus 0002/0003/0006: the 27.3 GPU, DCP and camera hand-offs), recipes in
installer/recipes/*-upstream. The J714s kernel pins follow the new release
7.3.0-17.up273-4-ARCH.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
